text It has been a while since Kappei has settled down in this town.
text Contrary to what I had expected, it seems Kappei has been busy with his part time job at the hospital, and I have not run into him as frequently as before.
text I suppose this is the difference between those who are students and those who aren't.
text Now that I think about it, in just a year, I will be thrown into society too.
text Once that happens, I guess the easygoing, carefree life I have been living will be no longer...
text Seeing Kappei makes me realize that.
text ─Even though that should be the case, but...
